{
  "title": "AZ · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "Region 내부의 독립된 장애 영역인 Availability Zone이다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/az/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/az/#availability-zone-name\">Availability Zone Name</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/az/#availability-zone-id\">Availability Zone ID</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/az/#zonal-resources\">Zonal Resources</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/az/#regional-resources\">Regional Resources</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/az/#multi-az-design\">Multi-AZ Design</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/az/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/az/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/az/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>기초</span><span>06 / 62</span></div><h1>AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span></h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 5 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Availability Zone은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> 안에서 전력·네트워크·시설 장애를 분리하기 위한 인프라 경계다. 하나 이상의 Data Center로 구성될 수 있으므로 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span>를 건물 한 채와 동일시하지 않는다.</p><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a>는 서로 다른 장애 경계에 애플리케이션과 데이터를 분산하는 설계다. 두 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>가 같은 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span>에 있으면 인스턴스 장애에는 대비할 수 있어도 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span> 장애에는 함께 영향을 받을 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"리소스 범위와 AZ 장애\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>리소스 범위와 AZ 장애</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Zonal placement</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Subnet A</strong><small>AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span> A에 속함</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> + <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> + <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a></strong><small>같은 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span> 연결 조건</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span> A failure</strong><small>다른 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span>의 실행 환경 필요</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Regional design</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a></strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> 안의 Network 경계</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Subnet A + Subnet B</strong><small>각각 다른 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span></small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a> + <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">ASG</a></strong><small>남은 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span>로 서비스 유지</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\"><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>가 여러 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span>에 걸쳐도 Subnet 하나가 여러 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span>에 걸치지는 않는다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"availability-zone-name\"><h2>Availability Zone Name<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/#availability-zone-name\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>ap-northeast-2a 같은 이름은 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>에서 배치 위치를 지정할 때 사용한다. 오래된 일부 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>·계정 조합에서는 같은 이름이 계정마다 다른 물리 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span>를 가리킬 수 있다. 모든 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>의 이름이 항상 계정별로 다르다고 단정하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"availability-zone-id\"><h2>Availability Zone ID <span class=\"full-name\">(Identifier)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/#availability-zone-id\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>use1-az1처럼 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span> ID <span class=\"full-name\">(Identifier)</span>는 계정 사이에서 같은 물리 위치를 식별한다. 공유 Subnet이나 계정 간 배치 협의에서는 표시 이름보다 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span> ID <span class=\"full-name\">(Identifier)</span>가 안전하다. 현재 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 문서는 생성 시기와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>에 따라 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span> Name 매핑이 달라질 수 있음을 설명한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"zonal-resources\"><h2>Zonal Resources<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/#zonal-resources\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Subnet과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> Volume은 한 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span>에 속한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>에 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a>를 직접 연결하려면 같은 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span>여야 하며 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>도 같은 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>에 연결한다. 다른 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span>에서 저장 내용을 쓰려면 Snapshot 복원이나 공유 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">File Storage</a>를 검토한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"regional-resources\"><h2>Regional Resources<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/#regional-resources\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>는 여러 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span>의 Subnet을 담는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> 단위 네트워크다. Regional <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a>나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 같은 서비스는 서비스 자체의 복제·가용성 모델을 가진다. 리소스의 주소 범위와 실제 데이터 복제 범위를 구분한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"multi-az-design\"><h2>Multi-AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span> Design<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/#multi-az-design\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Load Balancer, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">Auto Scaling</a> Group, 데이터베이스의 복제·Failover를 함께 구성한다. AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span> 하나를 잃은 뒤 남은 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span>가 전체 부하를 감당할 수 있는지도 필요하다. 데이터는 복제되어도 애플리케이션 연결 재시도나 장애 조치 절차가 없으면 복구가 지연된다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a> 뒤에 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span> A와 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span> B의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>를 배치하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a>를 사용하면 웹·데이터 계층의 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span> 장애를 함께 다룰 수 있다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>같은 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span> 안의 두 인스턴스만으로는 AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span> 장애를 견디지 못한다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/global-infrastructure/latest/regions/az-ids.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">global-infrastructure/latest/regions/az-ids.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q001/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q001\" data-question=\"Q001\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q001</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q001/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application must remain available during a prolonged outage of the entire Seoul Region. What is the minimum scope for replication?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q001\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A different AWS Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q001\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A different subnet in the Seoul Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q001\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A different Availability Zone in the Seoul Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q001\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A different ENI in the same Availability Zone</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 분리는 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 안의 장애를 다룬다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 수준 장애는 별도 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 복제와 전환이 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q002\" data-question=\"Q002\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q002</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q002/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A web tier must withstand a data center failure within one Region. Which deployment is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q002\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Two ENIs on the same EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q002\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Two instances using one EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q002\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Two instances in a single Availability Zone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q002\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Instances deployed across different Availability Zones</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>는 독립적인 장애 영역이다. 서로 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>에 웹 인스턴스를 둔다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q005\" data-question=\"Q005\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q005</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q005/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company plans to create one subnet in each of two Availability Zones. Which resource contains the network address range for those subnets?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q005\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A VPC</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q005\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q005\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q005\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 범위이고 그 안의 각 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>은 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 속한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q011\" data-question=\"Q011\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q011</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q011/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application runs in two Availability Zones and uses zonal public NAT gateways. If one AZ fails, workloads in the surviving AZ must retain outbound internet access. Which NAT design should the architect use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q011\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Add only a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q011\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Use a single NAT gateway in AZ A</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q011\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Deploy a NAT gateway in each AZ and route each subnet to its local NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q011\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Attach one Elastic IP to both AZs simultaneously</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>와 경로는 단일 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a> 의존을 제거하고 교차 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 트래픽도 줄인다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q028\" data-question=\"Q028\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q028</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q028/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which placement strategy reduces network latency among HPC nodes within one Availability Zone?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q028\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A spread placement group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q028\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q028\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Instances in different Regions</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q028\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A cluster placement group</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · Cluster는 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 내 인스턴스를 가깝게 배치한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">이전 용어 <b>AWS Backup</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">다음 용어 <b>Budgets / Cost Explorer</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
